Description: Screen recorder, screenshots, text from the screen and clipboard history
 Framewise records the screen (an area, a window or the whole screen) with
 system sound, microphone and a camera bubble, and opens each recording in an
 editor with cuts, silence and filler-word removal, noise removal, zoom on
 click, backgrounds and export options (speed, size limit, GIF).
 .
 It also takes screenshots with a mark-up editor and pinning, copies text from
 any part of the screen (OCR), keeps a clipboard history, and adds camera
 effects (background blur, smooth skin, face light). Everything runs on this
 computer.
 .
 Made for GNOME on Ubuntu. Brought to you by @gitcotech.
